# Anti-slop

Follow `ANTI-SLOP.md`. The colour field keeps its current faces and layout.

- Text boxes fit their text. Use `--pad` (it scales with the line box). No fixed min-height on a text container.
- Prose uses `--measure` (`65ch`). Thai and Chinese keep that physical width.
- New Latin type is Jost (`--font-geometric`). New Thai is Prompt, then Kanit (`--font-thai-geometric`, `lang="th"`). Chinese is Noto Sans SC (`--font-hans`, `lang="zh-Hans"`).
- Banned as a design face: Inter, Poppins, Montserrat, Roboto, Open Sans, Lato, DM Sans, Space Grotesk, Geist, Plus Jakarta Sans, Manrope, Nunito, and system-ui.
- Something on the page must win. New steps are `--type-body`, `--type-title`, `--type-display`, at least 1.5 times apart. No equal-weight cards. No boxes, gradients, or shadows added to fill space.
- Do not restyle the exhibition off Archivo Narrow, IBM Plex Sans Thai, Noto Sans SC, JetBrains Mono, or the reading room's Arial.

`npm run check` runs `scripts/check-anti-slop.mjs`.
